note The entry the gui crate calls: create the event loop, pick the window mode from the environment, build the runner around the app and hand it to winit. It returns when the loop exits - the window closed or a frame asked to quit - and a failure to open the window or the GPU comes back as the StartError the runner kept, rather than a panic.

